
         Upload Activities (WHAT) v1.0 by Bobo/Mystic - Updates!
=============================================================================
           { + }-New feature(s)         { - }-Removed feature
           { * }-changed feature        { ! }-fixed feature (Bug)
           { # }-Information            { ? }-let me know if this work

What v0.5 (10-12-93 > 11-01-93) - [Private version for my board]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
First version, coded in Arexx by Bobo

10-12-93 { + } I started coding this door.
 - ^^ -  { + } Main source for listing a directory coded. (Using C:LIST)
10-13-93 { * } Now using AREXXs inbuilt LIST command instaid of using C:LIST
10-15-93 { * } Fixed a nicer design.
10-17-93 { # } WHAT do not list the playpen directory in the correct order.
               Hope i found away to do that in the future..

What v1.0 (01-30-94 > 04-19-94) - [First public release version]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
First C version, no bugs known!

01-30-94 { + } Recoded the AREXX version of WHAT into C
02-02-94 { ! } Now sorting the files in correct order.
02-04-94 { * } Now using comma-seperator at the filelengths
02-10-94 { + } Now showing Total files and Total bytes.
02-13-94 { ! } Now unlocking files, libs and free allocated memory when a
               error occur.
02-16-94 { * } Now more optimized routine when reading from icons.
03-14-94 { ! } ** MAJOR BUG DETECTED ** "What" did not lock the playpen dir
               in shared mode! This means it could bug and guru when it
               was used on two nodes at the same time.
 - ^^ -  { # } I would really need the routines to check if a node is quiet
               or not! Tell me at once if you have any!
 - ^^ -  { + } Now you can have a icon in doors: WHAT.INFO.
               Available tooltypes: SKIP_NODE<node>,NODES=<nodes>
                                    START_NODE=<node>,PLAYPEN<node>=<dir>
04-19-94 { - } Registration routines removed.
               Final size: 14672 (Source 11414 with comments)
